---
/* The live surfaces on a synthetic sample ring and step blocks: the compass
   fan's ghost arrows age toward the ring, and the step summaries carry the
   direction's recent story. Both are wired by the page script from the
   same deterministic fixtures as everything else. */
---

<section class="station-section" id="live-theatre" aria-labelledby="live-theatre-title">
  <h2 id="live-theatre-title">Live theatre</h2>
  <p class="station-note">
    <code>&lt;meteo-compass-fan&gt;</code> draws every sample of the rolling
    window as a faint arrow aged by tenth — a tight fan means steady
    direction — with the newest as the solid needle;
    <code>&lt;meteo-recent-summaries&gt;</code> panels the source's own
    1-minute and 5-minute step blocks. Both wear the launch window's
    verdict.
  </p>
  <div class="station-grid station-grid-roses">
    <div class="station-panel">
      <h3><code>&lt;meteo-compass-fan&gt;</code>: the ghost fan</h3>
      <meteo-compass-fan
        favorable-directions='[{"fromDeg":260,"toDeg":340}]'
        id="live-fan"></meteo-compass-fan>
    </div>
    <div class="station-panel">
      <h3><code>&lt;meteo-recent-summaries&gt;</code>: the step blocks</h3>
      <meteo-recent-summaries
        favorable-directions='[{"fromDeg":260,"toDeg":340}]'
        id="live-summaries"></meteo-recent-summaries>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
